---
import MockStatusBadge from "./MockStatusBadge.astro";
import MockWindow from "./MockWindow.astro";
---

<MockWindow title="第四册交接卡 · 教学仿真">
  <div class="handoff-mock">
    <div class="handoff-mock__heading">
      <div>
        <p class="mock-heading">app.example.com 公开入口</p>
        <p class="mock-small">只记录对象、位置、负责人和验证方法，不记录凭证值。</p>
      </div>
      <MockStatusBadge>可交接</MockStatusBadge>
    </div>

    <dl class="handoff-mock__grid">
      <div>
        <dt>域名与续费</dt>
        <dd>注册商、到期日、自动续费、联系邮箱</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Cloudflare zone</dt>
        <dd>example.com · Active · 负责人</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Tunnel</dt>
        <dd>book04-web · connector 运行位置</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Published route</dt>
        <dd>app.example.com → http://127.0.0.1:8080</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>源站项目</dt>
        <dd>$HOME/docker-labs/compose-web</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>恢复入口</dt>
        <dd>本机 curl、systemd、Compose、Cloudflare 控制台</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <div class="handoff-mock__secret" role="note">
      <strong>敏感信息：</strong>
      <span>仅记录“保存在哪里”和“由谁管理”；不得粘贴 token、密码、私钥或恢复码。</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</MockWindow>

<style>
  .handoff-mock {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .handoff-mock__heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .handoff-mock__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .handoff-mock__grid div {
    min-width: 0;
    border: var(--border-thin);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }

  .handoff-mock__grid dt {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .handoff-mock__grid dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .handoff-mock__secret {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    border-left: 0.25rem solid var(--color-warning);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-warning-soft);
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .handoff-mock__heading,
    .handoff-mock__secret {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .handoff-mock__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media print {
    .handoff-mock__grid div,
    .handoff-mock__secret {
      border-color: #888888;
      background: white;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }
  }
</style>
